{"strongs": "H3097", "word": "יוֺאָב", "translit": "yo.av", "root": "הוד", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "is father", "definition": "יוֺאָב proper name, masculine ( ׳ י is father ; compare אֲבִיָּהוּ , אֱלִיאָב , אֲבִיאֵל & references) — 1. David's sister's son & captain of his host ( ᵐ5 Ἰωαβ ) 1Sam 26:6 ; 2Sam 2:13 + 100 t. 2 Samuel (also 2Sam 20:6 for ᵑ0 אֲבִישַׁי compare ᵑ6 We Dr ); 1Kgs 1:7 + 14 t. 1 Kings; 1Chr 2:16 + 22 t. 1 Chronicles; Ps 60:2 . 2. a descendant of Judah 1Chr 4:14 (but ᵐ5 B ᵐ5 L Ἰωβαβ ). 3. a family-name after the exile Ezra 2:6 = Neh 7:11 ( ᵐ5 Ἰωβαβ , Ἰωαβ ) Ezra 8:9 ( ᵐ5 Ἰωαβ ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2123')\">BDB2123</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3097')\">H3097</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2122')\">BDB2122</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2124')\">BDB2124</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יוֺאָב</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>is father</highlight>; compare <bdbheb>אֲבִיָּהוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אֱלִיאָב</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אֲבִיאֵל</bdbheb> &amp; references) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> David's sister's son &amp; captain of his host (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰωαβ</grk>) <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,6)\">1Sam 26:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 2:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,2,13)\">2Sam 2:13</ref> + 100 t. 2 Samuel (also <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,6)\">2Sam 20:6</ref> for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>אֲבִישַׁי</bdbheb> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick